{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23291","headline":"江楼晚眺景物鲜奇吟翫成篇寄水部张员外 · 白居易","name":"江楼晚眺景物鲜奇吟翫成篇寄水部张员外","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"澹烟疎雨间斜阳，江色鲜明海气凉。\n蜃散云收破楼阁，虹残水照断桥梁。\n风翻白浪花千片，雁点青天字一行。\n好着丹青图画取，题诗寄与水曹郎。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23291.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23291","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}